      "content": "thanks for saying that but i really dont think it is a stroke. i literally just had a migraine two months ago that felt exactly like this, even the vision stuff. i dont have any other symptoms like confusion or trouble talking. plus the er is gonna cost me a fortune and i just want to sleep it off. do u think there is any chance it is just a really bad aura? maybe i can just take some extra ibuprofen and wait a bit?",
